### 1.4 Storage in Mission Control Context

For agents assigned to Helux-managed gateways:

```
~/.openclaw/
├── openclaw.json              # Global config + channel bindings
├── agents/
│   ├── main/                  # Default agent
│   │   ├── agent              # State + auth profiles
